Changes: inference-only symbol extraction; training recipes, losses and
entrypoints removed; Python package paths adapted; portable PyTorch SDPA
selected instead of optional private CUDA extensions. Checkpoint parameter
names and inference coordinate mathematics are retained.
See docs/model_source_manifest.json for source-module fingerprints and
../LICENSE_POLICY.md for attribution and external dependency boundaries.

The H1 native IK wrapper is adapted from the deployment client. The external
native solver, SDK binaries and robot description assets are installed
separately under their respective license terms. Model weights and training
data are not distributed in this source package.
The H1 motion and camera SDKs are external libraries supplied by the user.
SDK source, binaries and vendor examples are not bundled or automatically
installed by the deployment packages or inference image.

